muew-preset 2
name Fold Growl
category Bass
author MUEW Factory
tags growl fold aggressive dark
desc Wave-folded bass that growls as the fold amount moves. Push WARP for more bite.
osc1Shape 3
osc2Shape 2
osc2Detune -12
osc2Level 0.45
filterCutoff 1400
filterReso 1.6
filterMode 0
amp 0.003 0.3 0.7 0.12
mod 0.005 0.4 0.2 0.1
lfo1Rate 3
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 6 0.25
warp2 6 0
mseg 0.5 1 5 0 0 0.25 1 0.5 0.1 0.75 0.8 1 0
routes 8
route 4 5 0.55
route 1 2 1.4
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
